        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Musa wakaambila Aroni kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova, Njoosalazigwa kuliboonse baswena kulindime akulemekwa kumeso aabantu boonse. Lino Aroni wakaumuna buyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
