        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi mutazwi kumulyango watente lyambunganino, kuti mutafwi, nkaambo mafuta aakunanika aa-Jehova mpaali alindinywe. Nkabela bakacita mbubonya mbuli Musa mbwaakalailila,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
