              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleelede kucilida mubusena busalalisya, nkaambo ncecaabilo cako acaabilo cabana bako akati kazipaizyo zitentelwa Jehova, Nkaambo mbuboobo mbundakalaililwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
